"w"},{"n":"Viridescent Venerer","r":[0.5231,0.2567,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City","r":[0.5231,0.327,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Golden Troupe","r":[0.5231,0.3974,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Lan Yan","r":[0.0815,0.5237,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Arlecchino","r":[0.1231,0.5237,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.1648,0.5237,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2065,0.5237,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lan Yan","r":[0.0815,0.5748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Clorinde","r":[0.1231,0.5748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1648,0.5748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.2065,0.5748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lan Yan","r":[0.0815,0.6259,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kamisato Ayaka","r":[0.1231,0.6259,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.1648,0.6259,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Rosaria","r":[0.2065,0.6259,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lan Yan","r":[0.0815,0.677,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Wanderer","r":[0.1231,0.677,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Faruzan","r":[0.1648,0.677,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2065,0.677,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/lanyan/261111-225049/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Starcaller's Watch","text":"Elemental Mastery and a strong team damage buff when she shields an ally; excellent premium support choice. Shielding support; ATK shield can be weaker than with high-ATK weapons."},{"name":"Crane's Echoing Call","text":"High base ATK supports stronger shields, with a plunge buff for teams using a plunging carry. Plunge teams with Xianyun or Xiao; passive requires plunge hits."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"At R5, gives the next character 48% ATK for 10s, making it an outstanding accessible carry buff. ATK-scaling on-field carry; low weapon base ATK lowers shield strength. R5 strongly recommended."},{"name":"Hakushin Ring","text":"Energy Recharge plus elemental damage buffs after Electro-related reactions; especially useful in Aggravate teams. Electro team and a relevant reaction triggered by Lan Yan. Higher refinements improve the buff."},{"name":"Sacrificial Fragments","text":"Provides Elemental Mastery and can reset Skill cooldown for extra shields, Swirls and flexible rotations. On-field driver or long rotations; reset depends on refinement. R3+ preferred for consistency."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"Energy Recharge and neutral particles reduce the team's Energy needs when she lands a CRIT hit. Build enough CRIT Rate to trigger the passive reliably. Higher refinements improve consistency."},{"name":"Prototype Amber","text":"Restores Energy and heals the team after Burst; useful for extra comfort when Burst is available. Only valuable when Bursting regularly; HP% does not strengthen her ATK shield. Higher refinements improve healing and Energy."},{"name":"Wandering Evenstar","text":"Elemental Mastery converts partly into flat ATK for Lan Yan and nearby allies, even while off-field. EM-focused driver or hybrid build. Higher refinements improve ATK sharing."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Swirl cuts the affected Pyro, Hydro, Electro or Cryo RES by 40% for 10s; ideal for most elemental carries.","stats":"ATK% / ATK% / ATK%; ER or CRIT Rate as needed"},{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Grants 12% Anemo DMG Bonus through Swirl, useful for Wanderer or Xiao when VV does not buff the main damage type.","stats":"ATK% / ATK% / ATK%; optional ER"},{"names":["Golden Troupe"],"text":"Boosts her Skill damage in a quickswap build; sacrifices the valuable team buffs provided by VV or Scroll.","stats":"ATK% or EM / Anemo DMG / CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Crimson Featherguard","members":["Lan Yan","Arlecchino","Yelan","Bennett"],"text":"Lan Yan shields Arlecchino, shreds Pyro RES with VV and can pass a TTDS ATK buff. Bennett boosts ATK; Yelan enables Vaporize.","roles":["Shielder / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Electro Featherdance","members":["Lan Yan","Clorinde","Fischl","Nahida"],"text":"Lan Yan protects Clorinde and shreds Electro RES. Fischl and Nahida maintain Aggravate; Hakushin Ring is valuable here.","roles":["Shielder / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Dendro Enabler / Buffer"]},{"name":"Frozen Flight","members":["Lan Yan","Kamisato Ayaka","Xingqiu","Rosaria"],"text":"Lan Yan groups enemies, shields Ayaka and shreds Cryo RES. Xingqiu supplies Hydro while Rosaria adds Cryo damage.","roles":["Shielder / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / CRIT Buffer"]},{"name":"Wanderer Windguard","members":["Lan Yan","Wanderer","Faruzan","Bennett"],"text":"Lan Yan protects Wanderer from interruption and can use Scroll to grant Anemo DMG. Faruzan and Bennett amplify his damage.","roles":["Shielder / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Anemo Buffer / Debuffer","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Aggravate Shield: Use Hakushin Ring with 4pc VV in Electro teams; Swirl Electro before the damage dealer takes the field.\nAnemo Carry Support: Use 4pc Scroll with Wanderer or Xiao; 4pc VV cannot reduce enemy Anemo RES.\nOn-Field Swirl Driver: Build EM/EM/EM with 4pc VV and Sacrificial Fragments; trigger Swirls through Normal Attacks.\nQuickswap Skill DPS: Use 4pc Golden Troupe with damage stats; only when another unit handles the key team buffs.\nBudget Shield: 4pc VV and R5 Thrilling Tales boost ATK carries; build ATK% for shield strength.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Shielder"],"about":"Lan Yan is an ATK-scaling Anemo shielder who protects the on-field carry while reducing Pyro, Hydro, Electro or Cryo resistance with Viridescent Venerer. Her Skill can absorb one of those elements for stronger matching-element protection. NA also swirls.","pros":["Strong ATK-scaling shield","40% RES shred with VV","Flexible support weapons","C2 restores shield HP"],"cons":["Short shield duration","16s Skill cooldown","Burst can be ER-hungry","Needs setup for key Swirls"],"weapons":["Starcaller's Watch","Crane's Echoing Call","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Hakushin Ring","Sacrificial Fragments","Favonius Codex","Prototype Amber","Wandering Evenstar"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Anemo Carry"},{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Skill DPS"}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","ATK%","ATK% / CRIT Rate"],"stats":["ATK: 2,000 - 2,500+ (shield)","ER: 100% - 140% (Burst optional)","ER: 180% - 220% (solo Anemo, frequent Burst)","CRIT Rate: 40% - 60% (Favonius)"],"vars":[{"title":"Aggravate Shield Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Hakushin Ring","Favonius Codex","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% main stats for shield; add ER for C4 Burst buff and CRIT Rate for Favonius.","teams":"Electro carry plus Dendro support; Lan Yan must Swirl Electro.","when":"Use in Clorinde, Keqing or other Aggravate teams for shields, Electro RES shred and conditional Hakushin buffs.","cond":"Hakushin requires an Electro-related reaction by Lan Yan.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Anemo Carry Shield","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Codex","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Crane's Echoing Call"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% for stronger shields; ER only if Bursting every rotation.","teams":"Wanderer or Xiao as the main damage dealer; other teammates handle Anemo buffs.","when":"Use Scroll to grant a modest Anemo DMG buff while shielding your Anemo carry; VV cannot shred Anemo RES.","cond":"Shield lasts 12.5s and may not cover an entire extended rotation.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"On-Field Swirl Driver","role":"On-field Driver","weapons":["Sacrificial Fragments","Starcaller's Watch","Wandering Evenstar"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Elemental Mastery / EM / EM; level to 90 for stronger Swirl damage.","teams":"Off-field Hydro and Electro or Electro an